      "critical_criteria": "pickletools raises an error during analysis while pickle and/or _pickle deserializes correctly; can bypass scanners on Hugging Face and other platforms",
      "disclosed_to": "Python Software Foundation (CPython) + huntr.com bug bounty (awarded $750)",
      "fixes_released": 6,
      "note_on_security_column": "Table I marks Security Impact \u2713 on rows 1,2,3,5,7; the RQ2 text names exactly four scanner-bypass-critical discrepancies (#1,2,3,5) where pickletools errors while a deserializer succeeds. The extra \u2713 on #7 is transcribed verbatim from the table."
    },
